hadiths[42]{hadithnumber,text}:
"999","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar se aadhe phal ya kheti par muamla farmaya jo us se nikle. Phir Aap apni biwiyon ko sau wasaq dete: Assi wasaq khajoor, bees wasaq jau. Phir Umar ne Khaibar taqseem kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon ko ikhtiyar diya ke unhe pani aur zameen se qata karke diya jaye ya unhe wasaq jari rakha jaye. Phir un mein se jis ne zameen ikhtiyar ki, jis ne wasaq ikhtiyar kiya. Aur Aisha ne zameen ikhtiyar ki."
"1000","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Yahood aur Nasara ko Hijaz ki zameen se nikala. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Khaibar par ghalib aaye to Yahood ko us se nikalna chaha. Aur zameen jab Us par ghalib aaya Allah, Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Musalmanon ke liye thi. Aur Yahood ko us se nikalna chaha. Phir Yahood ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sawal kiya ke Aap unhe us mein rakhein ke wo us ka kaam karein aur unhe aadha phal mile. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Hum tumhe us mein is par rakhenge jab tak hum chahein. Phir wo us mein rahe yahan tak ke Umar ne unhe Taima aur Ariha ki taraf nikala."
"1001","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman darakht lagaye ya kheti boye, phir us mein se parinda, insan ya janwar khaye to us ke liye sadqa tha."
"1002","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phalon ki bai se mana farmaya yahan tak ke chamkein. Phir Aap se kaha gaya: Chamakna kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yahan tak ke surkh hon. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Batayo, jab Allah phal rok le to tum mein se ek apne bhai ka maal kis se le?"
"1003","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne darwaze par jhagadne walon ki buland awazein sunein. Jabke un mein se ek doosre se kami aur narmi ka sawal kar raha tha, aur wo kehta tha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi karunga. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas nikle. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah par qasam khane wala kahan hai ke bhalayi nahi karega? To us ne kaha: Main hun Ya Rasulullah! Aur us ke liye jo wo pasand kare."
"1004","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abi Hadrad se apna qarz manga jo un ka us par tha, masjid mein. Phir un dono ki awazein buland huein yahan tak ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe suna jabke Wo apne ghar mein they. Phir Aap un ke paas nikle yahan tak ke apne hujre ka parda uthaya. Phir pukara: Ae Ka'b! Unhon ne kaha: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Apne qarz mein se ye kam karo. Aur Aap ne us ki taraf ishara farmaya, matlab aadha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kiya Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Utho aur use ada karo."
"1005","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya [ya kaha main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna]: Jo apna maal ayn se paye kisi shakhs ya insan ke paas jo dewaliya ho gaya ho to wo us ka us ke siwa se zyada haq-dar hai."
"1006","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehle walon mein se ek shakhs ki rooh se farishte mile. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne bhalayi mein se kuchh kiya? Us ne kaha: Main apne ladkon ko hukm karta tha ke wo tang-dast ko mohlat dein aur maaldaar se darguzar karein. Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne us se darguzar kiya."
"1007","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ek saudagar logon ko udhaar deta tha. Phir jab tang-dast ko dekhta to apne ladkon se kehta: Us se darguzar karo. Shayad Allah hum se darguzar kare. Phir Allah ne us se darguzar farmaya."
"1008","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Maaldaar ka talna zulm hai. Phir jab tum mein se ek ko maaldaar par hawala diya jaye to use hawala le."
"1009","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Faltu pani na roka jaye taake us se ghaas roki jaye."
"1010","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kutte ki qeemat, zaniya ki ujrat aur kahin ke hadiye se mana farmaya."
"1011","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kutton ke qatl ka hukm farmaya."
"1012","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo kutta rakhe, siwaye maweshiyon ke kutte ya shikari ke, us ke amal mein se har din do qirat kam honge."
"1013","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo kutta rakhe to us ke amal mein se har din ek qirat kam hota hai, siwaye kheti ya maweshiyon ke kutte ke."
"1014","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sufyan bin Abi Zuhair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo kutta rakhe jo use kheti aur doodh se be-niyaz na kare, us ke amal mein se har din ek qirat kam hota hai."
"1015","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se seengi lagane wale ki ujrat ke bare mein poochha gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne seengi lagwayi. Abu Taiba ne Aap ko seengi lagayi. Aur Aap ne use khane ke do sa' diye. Aur us ke aaqaon se baat ki to unhon ne us se halka kiya. Aur farmaya: Beshak behtareen jis se tum ilaj karte ho seengi lagana aur samandari qust hai."
"1016","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne seengi lagwayi, seengi lagane wale ko us ki ujrat di aur naak mein dawa dali."
"1017","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Surah Baqara mein sood ke bare mein ayatein nazil huein to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) masjid ki taraf nikle aur unhe logon ko parh kar sunaya. Phir sharab ki tijarat ko haram farmaya."
"1018","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Fatah ke saal farmate suna, jabke Wo Makkah mein they: Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sharab, murdar, khinzeer aur buton ki bai ko haram farmaya. Phir arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Murdar ki charbi ke bare mein batayiye? Kyunke us se kashtiyon par roghn kiya jata hai, khaalon ko chikna kiya jata hai, log us se chiragh jalate hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, wo haram hai. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Allah Yahood se lade. Beshak Allah ne jab un ki charbi haram farmayi to unhon ne use pighlaya phir becha aur us ki qeemat khayi."
"1019","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar se Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ko khabar pahunchi ke falan ne sharab bechi. To unhon ne kaha: Allah falan se lade. Kya wo nahi janta ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Yahood se lade. Un par charbi haram hui to unhon ne use pighlaya aur becha."
"1020","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Yahood se lade. Un par charbi haram hui to unhon ne use becha aur us ki qeematein khayein."
"1021","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho magar barabar barabar. Aur us mein se ek ko doosre par zyada na karo. Aur chandi chandi se na becho magar barabar barabar. Aur us mein se ek ko doosre par zyada na karo. Aur us mein se ghayab ko hazir se na becho."
"1022","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib aur Zaid bin Arqam se Abu al-Minhal ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Bara bin Azib aur Zaid bin Arqam se sarf ke bare mein poochha. Phir un mein se har ek kehta hai: Ye mujh se behtar hai. Phir dono kehte hain: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sone ko chandi se udhaar bechne se mana farmaya."
"1023","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chandi ko chandi se aur sone ko sone se mana farmaya magar barabar barabar. Aur hamein hukm diya ke hum sona chandi se jaise chahein khareedein, aur chandi sona jaise chahein."
"1024","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri aur Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar par ek shakhs ko muqarrar farmaya. Phir wo Aap ke paas umda khajoor lekar aaya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya Khaibar ki tamam khajoor aisi hai? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum is mein se ek sa' do sa' se lete hain, do sa' teen se. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Mili-juli ko dirham se becho, phir dirham se umda khareedo."
"1025","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bilal Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas umda khajoor lekar aaye. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Ye kahan se hai? Bilal ne arz kiya: Hamare paas kharab khajoor thi. Phir main ne us mein se do sa' ek sa' se bechi taake Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khilayein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Afsos, afsos! Ayn sood, ayn sood! Aisa na karo. Lekin jab khareedna chaho to khajoor ko aur bai se becho phir khareedo."
"1026","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein mili-juli khajoor milti thi, jo khajoor ka milawat hai. Aur hum do sa' ek sa' se bechte. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Do sa' ek sa' se nahi, do dirham ek dirham se nahi."
"1027","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri aur Usama se Abu Salih al-Zayyat ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Deenar deenar se aur dirham dirham se [unhon ne kaha]: Phir main ne un se kaha: Beshak Ibn Abbas ye nahi kehte. To Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Main ne un se poochha. Phir main ne kaha: Tum ne use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna ya Allah ki kitab mein paya? Unhon ne kaha: Ye sab main nahi kehta. Aur tum mujh se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko zyada jante ho. Lekin mujhe Usama ne khabar di ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sood sirf udhaar mein hai."
"1028","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Halal wazeh hai aur haram wazeh hai. Aur un dono ke darmiyan shubhe wali cheezein hain jinhe logon mein se aksar nahi jante. Phir jo shubhe wali cheezon se bache us ne apne deen aur izzat ko bacha liya. Aur jo shubhon mein pada charwahe jaisa hai jo charagah ke ird-gird charata hai, anqareeb us mein padega. Suno! Beshak har badshah ki charagah hoti hai. Suno! Beshak zameen mein Allah ki charagah Us ki hurmatein hain. Suno! Beshak jism mein gosht ka tukda hai, jab wo durust ho to poora jism durust hota hai. Jab wo bigde to poora jism bigadta hai. Suno! Wo dil hai."
"1029","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo apne oont par chal rahe they jo thak gaya tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) guzre aur use mara aur us ke liye dua farmayi. Phir wo aise chalne laga jo is jaisa nahi chalta. Phir farmaya: Use mujhe ooqiya mein bech do. Main ne arz kiya: Nahi. Phir farmaya: Use mujhe ooqiya mein bech do. Phir main ne use becha. Aur main ne apne ghar walon tak us ki sawari mustasna ki. Phir jab hum aaye to main usے oont lekar aaya. Aur Aap ne mujhe us ki qeemat naqd di. Phir main phira. Phir Aap ne mere peechhe bheja. Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhara oont lene wala na tha. Phir apna oont lo, wo tumhara maal hai."
"1030","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ladayi ki. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujh se mile jabke main hamare pani dhone wale oont par tha jo thak gaya tha aur mushkil se chalta tha. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhare oont ko kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Thak gaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) peechhe rahe aur use hankaya aur us ke liye dua farmayi. Phir wo oonton ke samne un ke aage chalne laga. Phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Apne oont ko kaisa dekhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Bhalayi se, use tumhari barkat lagi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum use mujhe bechte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main sharmaya, jabke hamare paas us ke siwa pani dhone wala na tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir use mujhe bech do. Phir main ne use Aap ko becha is par ke mere liye us ki peeth ka faida hai yahan tak ke Madina pahunchoon. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main dulha hun. Phir main ne Aap se ijazat mangi. To Aap ne mujhe ijazat de di. Phir main logon se aage Madina ki taraf badha, yahan tak ke Madina aaya. Phir mera mamun mujhe mila aur us ne mujh se oont ke bare mein poochha. Phir main ne use khabar di jo main ne us mein kiya tha. Phir us ne mujhe malamat ki. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha jab main ne Aap se ijazat mangi thi: Kya tum ne kunwari se nikah kiya ya bewah se? Phir main ne arz kiya: Main ne bewah se nikah kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kunwari kyun nahi jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khele? Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Mere walid faut ho gaye, ya shaheed hue, jabke meri chhoti behnein hain. Phir main ne na-pasand kiya ke un jaisi se nikah karun. Phir wo unhe adab na sikhaye aur un ki dekh-bhaal na kare. Phir main ne bewah se nikah kiya taake wo un ki dekh-bhaal kare aur unhe adab sikhaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye to main subah Aap ke paas oont lekar aaya. Phir Aap ne mujhe us ki qeemat di aur use mujhe lautaya."
"1031","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se oont do ooqiya aur ek ya do dirham mein khareeda. Phir jab Aap Sirar tashreef laye to gaay ka hukm diya aur wo zibah ki gayi. Phir unhon ne us mein se khaya. Phir jab Aap Madina tashreef laye to mujhe hukm diya ke masjid aaun aur do rakatein parhun. Aur mere liye oont ki qeemat toli."
"1032","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Aap se taqaza karte aaya aur sakhti ki. Phir Aap ke sahaba ne us ka irada kiya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use chhoro. Kyunke haq wale ke liye baat hai. Phir farmaya: Use us ke daant jaisa daant do. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Magar us ke daant se behtar. To Aap ne farmaya: Use do. Kyunke tum mein se behtar wo hai jo ada karne mein sab se acha hai."
"1033","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Yahoodi se muddat tak khana khareeda aur use lohe ki zirah girwi rakhi."
"1034","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye jabke wo khajoor mein do aur teen saal udhaar dete. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez mein udhaar de to maloom nap aur maloom wazan mein, maloom muddat tak."
"1035","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Qasam saman ko chalati hai, barkat ko mitati hai."
"1036","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shuf'a ka faisla farmaya har us mein jo taqseem na hua ho. Phir jab hudood waqe hon aur raste pher diye jayein to shuf'a nahi."
"1037","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne padosi ko manع na kare ke wo apni lakdi us ki deewar mein gaade. Phir Abu Hurairah kehte: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhe us se munh pherte dekhta hun? Allah ki qasam! Main use tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan maarunga."
"1038","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Arwa ne us se haq mein jhagda kiya, jis ka us ne dawa kiya ke us ne us ke liye kam kiya hai, Marwan ke paas. To Sa'id ne kaha: Kya main us ke haq mein se koi cheez kam karunga? Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo zameen se balisht bhar zulm se le, beshak use Qayamat ke din saat zameenon se tauk pehnaya jayega."
"1039","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Abu Salama ke hawale se riwayat hai ke un ke aur logon ke darmiyan jhagda tha. Phir unhon ne Aisha se zikr kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Abu Salama! Zameen se bacho. Kyunke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo balisht bhar zameen zulm kare use saat zameenon se tauk pehnaya jayega."
"1040","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim ne faisla farmaya jab wo raste mein jhagdein, saat gaz se."
